{
  "audio_file": "group_3_pair_1_statement1.wav",
  "duration": 65.6,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": 0,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 6.84,
      "duration": 6.84,
      "text": "Every AI agent, regardless of type, is built from the same fundamental components."
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "start": 7.52,
      "end": 8.76,
      "duration": 1.24,
      "text": "There's the perception layer."
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 9.42,
      "end": 13.5,
      "duration": 4.08,
      "text": "This is how the agent receives information from the world around it."
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 14.34,
      "end": 19.82,
      "duration": 5.48,
      "text": "At Solara, that might mean reading an incoming data feed from a solar installation,"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 20.64,
      "end": 25.14,
      "duration": 4.5,
      "text": "receiving a user query, or picking up a trigger from a monitoring system."
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 25.62,
      "end": 27.08,
      "duration": 1.46,
      "text": "There's the memory layer."
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 27.08,
      "end": 36.54,
      "duration": 9.46,
      "text": "As we covered in the last topic, agents hold short-term context within a task and can access long-term memory from external storage."
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 36.94,
      "end": 43.38,
      "duration": 6.44,
      "text": "This is what allows an agent to reason across multiple steps without losing track of where it is."
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 43.92,
      "end": 54.92,
      "duration": 11.0,
      "text": "There's the reasoning engine, the LLM, which interprets what the agent has perceived, decides what to do next, and determines which tools to use."
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 55.4,
      "end": 56.84,
      "duration": 1.44,
      "text": "And there's the action layer."
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 57.26,
      "end": 59.74,
      "duration": 2.48,
      "text": "This is where the agent does something in the world."
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 60.38,
      "end": 65.12,
      "duration": 4.74,
      "text": "Runs a query, calls an API, writes a file, sends an alert."
    }
  ],
